PREBUILT RELEASES
  A prebuilt release (tools/release/package.sh) bundles third-party software under
  its own licences: AzerothCore and mod-playerbots (GPL-2.0; some AzerothCore
  files are AGPL-3.0, see docs/adr/0012-going-public.md), Oracle MySQL (GPL-2.0
  with Oracle's additional permissions), OpenSSL (Apache-2.0), Boost (BSL-1.0),
  python-build-standalone/CPython (PSF and the licences of the libraries it links)
  and the other libraries listed in the release's THIRD_PARTY/INDEX.json, whose
  folder holds every licence text. The release's source assets (Moonglade at the
  tag, AzerothCore and mod-playerbots at the fork.lock commits with patches/
  applied, the MySQL source) are published next to it. Release servers link a
  small readline stand-in (tools/release/readline-stub, GPL-2.0-or-later) instead
  of GNU readline. No client or game files are in a release.

